{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2913","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2913","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2913\",\"parent_revision\":\"7892b03fdb63e66f23b6ddb1ba3e3197bfc82237\",\"root_revision\":\"30286f96f86ed8e57bef43f784fa6594943a47a7df39a60c0df66c1c99ad8ab0\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: Ideas\\ntype: Refactor\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-16\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nDiscovered while fixing the stale-mutation-clobber bug in PR #2906. _ContentPersistence.put() (the Protocol) doesn't document that implementations must self-validate create_only/expected_revision against current server state on every call \u2014 only the concrete _GitHubContentsStore happens to do this (it independently re-fetches and re-validates, ignoring the cached param entirely). The PR #2906 fix (dequeue stale pending mutations on a fresh direct write) is now the only Protocol-level enforced guarantee against the clobber bug class; a future non-GitHub content backend whose put() does NOT self-validate would only be protected by that dequeue-on-write behavior, not by any documented contract. Add a docstring note to _ContentPersistence.put() stating the expected self-validation behavior, or make it explicit that callers can't rely on it and must design accordingly.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the codebase**, I want to **docs(backlog-mcp): _contentpersistence.put() protocol doesn't document its create_only/expected_revision self-validation contract** so that **the code is cleaner and more maintainable**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Not specified\\n- **Priority**: Ideas\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-16\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"0fc0b30be4b8f7b0b509ccfb2ec02326186eeaa2904be9e89d2562ee874ce05a\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPgw0lQ\"}"}